<div>
	<section class="border-b border-line bg-surface">
		<div
			class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-28 lg:px-12"
		>
			<div>
				<span class="eyebrow">Let's talk</span>
				<h1
					class="mt-6 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-[.96] tracking-[-.065em] sm:text-7xl text-start"
				>
					Good technology starts with listening.
				</h1>
			</div>
			<div class="max-w-2xl text-lg text-muted sm:text-xl">
				There is no wrong place to begin. A rough idea, a system that keeps
				breaking, or a growing team that has outgrown its tools are all strong
				signals that it is time for a change.
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="border-b border-line">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl gap-10 px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-28">
			<h2
				class="max-w-md text-3xl font-medium leading-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl tracking=[-.04em]"
			>
				Tell us what you know. We'll handle the rest.
			</h2>
			<p class="max-w-2xl text-lg text-muted sm:text-xl mt-10">
				The best projects start with a clear picture of the problem. Share the
				context, constraints, and direction you have so far. We will take it
				from there.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
	<section class="cta">
		<div
			class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-12 px-5 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-28 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-24 lg:px-12"
		>
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow">Start a conversation</p>
				<h2 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-medium tracking-tighter sm:text-5xl">
					Bring us the complicated stuff.
				</h2>
				<p class="mt-6 leading-7 text-muted">
					Tell us what is changing, what is stuck, or what needs to exist. We'll
					use the details to understand whether<br>Nightmare Software is the
					right technical partner.
				</p>
			</div>
			<form class="space-y-5" id="contact-form">
				<label
					class="block font-mono text-xs tracking-[.12em] text-muted uppercase"
					>Name
					<input
						class="form-control mt-2"
						name="name"
						placeholder="You, the one who keeps things moving."
						required
					>
				</label>
				<label
					class="block font-mono text-xs tracking-[.12em] text-muted uppercase"
					>Work email
					<input
						class="form-control mt-2"
						name="email"
						type="email"
						placeholder="you@company.com (the inbox you actually check)"
						required
					>
				</label>
				<label
					class="block font-mono text-xs tracking-[.12em] text-muted uppercase"
					>What are you working on?
					<textarea
						class="form-control mt-2"
						name="brief"
						rows="6"
						placeholder="What is stuck, strange, or held together by spreadsheets? Start anywhere."
						required
					/>
				</label>
				<button type="submit" class="button-light mt-8 cursor-pointer">
					Hand over the hard stuff ↗
				</button>
			</form>
		</div>
	</section>
</div>

<script>
const contactForm = document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>("#contact-form");

contactForm?.addEventListener("submit", (event) => {
	event.preventDefault();
	const formData = new FormData(contactForm);
	const name = String(formData.get("name") ?? "");
	const email = String(formData.get("email") ?? "");
	const brief = String(formData.get("brief") ?? "");
	const subject = `Website inquiry from ${name}`;
	const body = `Name: ${name}\nWork email: ${email}\n\nWhat I'm working on:\n${brief}`;
	const mailto = `mailto:hello@nightmare.software?subject=${encodeURIComponent(subject)}&body=${encodeURIComponent(body)}`;

	window.location.href = mailto;
});
</script>
